flowchart TB
  accTitle: An iterative community lifecycle
  accDescr: Start with purpose and scope, establish governance, membership and services, agree sharing rules and build trust, choose architecture and address security and compliance, then operate, measure, improve and federate. Operational lessons feed back into purpose and scope; these activities can overlap.

  purpose["Purpose and scope"]:::accent
  people["Governance, membership<br/>and services"]
  trust["Sharing rules, trust<br/>and engagement"]
  tools["Architecture, security<br/>and compliance"]
  improve["Operate, measure,<br/>improve and federate"]:::success

  purpose -->|Define shared value| people
  people -->|Agree responsibilities| trust
  trust -->|Translate rules into controls| tools
  tools -->|Support useful sharing| improve
  improve -->|Revisit needs and decisions| purpose
